title: "Beyond AI Audit Trails: The Three Foundations of Verifiable Decision Evidence"
version: 3.3
message: "If you cite this work, please cite the paper and, if you use the benchmark, the benchmark's records."
authors:
  - given-names: Rajinder
    family-names: Jhol
type: generic
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
url: "https://github.com/rajinderjhol/personavault-docs"
abstract: >-
  A three-ontology framework for verifiable decision evidence — sequence,
  provenance, and authority — with a working artifact (the Clinical Decision
  Object) and an offline verifier (the Clinical Decision Receipt). Includes a
  ten-record benchmark that tests the verifier against adversarial and
  incomplete records.
